{"version":"0.1.0","license":"propriétaire","license_files":["MIT-hsk30.txt","UNICODE-LICENSE.txt","MIT-cjk-decomp.txt"],"source":"liste HSK 3.0 (GF 0025-2021) : caractères data/sources/listes/hsk-*.txt, mots data/sources/listes/hsk-mots.tsv (ivankra/hsk30, MIT) ; pinyin des caractères d'Unihan ; décomposition GF 0014-2009 réconciliée par le pipeline wenlu ; sens et exemples rédigés pour l'app et relus","source_url":"https://github.com/jon-gyt/zilin","modified":"2026-09-30 : assemblé par `wenlu export`","lot":7,"entrees":{"丛":{"c":"丛","pinyin":"cóng","lectures":["cóng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["人","人","一"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L7-0645"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"buisson, fourré ; groupe","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"buisson, fourré ; groupe, ensemble"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"从":{"c":"从","pinyin":"cóng","lectures":["cóng","cōng"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["人","人"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0054","L2-0084","L3-0117","L3-0118","L3-0119","L3-0958","L4-0127","L5-0145","L5-0146","L5-0250","L6-0171","L6-0172","L7-0637","L7-0638","L7-0639","L7-0640","L7-0641","L7-0642","L7-0643","L7-0644","L7-2577","L7-3876","L7-4108"],"chemin":{"hsk":4,"lire":4},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"depuis, à partir de, suivre","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我从北京来。","pinyin":"Wǒ cóng Běijīng lái.","fr":"Je viens de Pékin.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 从 montre deux hommes 人 de profil, l'un derrière l'autre. Le Shuowen jiezi y lit l'idée de suivre. La forme traditionnelle 從 y a ajouté un chemin et un pied, et la forme simplifiée revient à la plus ancienne.","en":"On oracle bones, 从 shows two people 人 in profile, one walking behind the other. The Shuowen jiezi reads it as “to follow”. The traditional form 從 added a road and a foot, and the simplified form goes back to the oldest one