.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"寸":{"c":"寸","pinyin":"cùn","lectures":["cùn"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L4-0097","L5-0149","L7-1116"],"chemin":{"hsk":94,"lire":93},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"pouce chinois (mesure)","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这张照片是两寸的。","pinyin":"Zhè zhāng zhàopiàn shì liǎng cùn de.","fr":"C'est une photo au format deux pouces.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi compose 寸 de la main 又 et d'un trait qui marque, à un pouce du poignet, l'endroit où l'on prend le pouls. De là vient sa valeur de mesure, le pouce chinois, dixième partie du pied 尺. Dans 对, il tient la place d'une main qui agit ; dans 过, il remplace simplement une partie plus complexe de l'ancien 過.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi builds 寸 from a hand, 又, and a stroke marking the spot an inch up the wrist where the pulse is taken. Hence its use as a measure, the Chinese inch, a tenth of the foot 尺. In 对 it stands for a hand at work; in 过 it simply replaces a more complex part of the old 過.","roles":{}}},"搓":{"c":"搓","pinyin":"cuō","lectures":["cuō"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","羊","工"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0666"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"frotter entre les mains","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"frotter entre les mains"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"天太冷了，他不停地搓手。","pinyin":"Tiān tài lěng le, tā bùtíng de cuō shǒu.","fr":"Il fait si froid qu'il se réchauffe les mains sans arrêt.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"磋":{"c":"磋","pinyin":"cuō","lectures":["cuō"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["石","羊","工"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0667"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"discuter, se concerter","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"discuter, se concerter"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"挫":{"c":"挫","pinyin":"cuò","lectures":["cuò"],"niveau":7,"decompo