, dit qu'on parle d'animaux. Au-dessus, un 横钩 et 龰, le bas d'un pied, comme une bête qui marche encore dans sa coquille. Ce que pondent les oiseaux et les bêtes, c'est l'œuf.","en":"As a memory aid: at the bottom, 虫, the little creature, tells you this is about animals. Above it are a hooked stroke and 龰, the lower part of a foot, like a creature still walking inside its shell. What birds and creatures lay is an egg.","roles":{"乛":"forme","龰":"forme","虫":"sens"}}},"诞":{"c":"诞","pinyin":"dàn","lectures":["dàn"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["讠","廴","丿","止"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L6-0197","L6-0731","L7-0750","L7-1770"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"naissance ; absurde","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"naissance, anniversaire"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"absurde, extravagant"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"当":{"c":"当","pinyin":"dāng","lectures":["dāng","dàng"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["⺌","彐"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0107","L2-0108","L3-0137","L3-0138","L3-0139","L3-0140","L3-0787","L3-0846","L5-0060","L5-0181","L5-0182","L5-0183","L5-0184","L5-0185","L6-0199","L6-0200","L6-0201","L6-0202","L6-0641","L6-0713","L6-0747","L6-1059","L7-0497","L7-0737","L7-0754","L7-0755","L7-0756","L7-0757","L7-0758","L7-0759","L7-0760","L7-0761","L7-0762","L7-0763","L7-0764","L7-0765","L7-0766","L7-0790","L7-2574","L7-2818","L7-2832","L7-3731","L7-4219","L7-4516"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"être, servir de ; lors de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"être, servir de, faire office de"},{"categorie":"Prep","fr":"au moment où, lors de"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"considérer comme, prendre pour","pinyin":"dàng"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他想当老师。","pinyin":"Tā xiǎng dāng lǎoshī.","fr":"Il veut devenir professeur.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"你当我是孩子吗？","pinyin":"Nǐ dàng wǒ shì háizi ma?","fr":"Tu me prends pour un enfant ?","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi écrit 當 et le glose « champs qui se correspondent » : 田, le champ, et 尚 pour le son. Deux choses qui se valent : de là « correspondre, tenir lieu de », puis « au moment où ». La forme simplifiée ne garde que ⺌ en haut et y met 彐 dessous, sans son ni sens.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi writes 當 and glosses it as “fields that match”: 田, the field, and 尚 for the sound. Two things of equal worth: hence “to match, to serve as”, then “at the time when”. The simplified form keeps only ⺌ on top and puts 彐 under it, with neither sound nor meaning.","roles":{"⺌":"forme","彐":"forme"}}},"党":{"c":"党","pinyin":"dǎng","lectures":["dǎng"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["⺌","冖","口","儿"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0198","L6-1061"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"parti (politique)","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"parti politique"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他十八岁就入了党。","pinyin":"Tā shíbā suì jiù rù le dǎng.","fr":"Il a adhéré au parti à dix-huit ans.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"挡":{"c":"挡","pinyin":"dǎng","lectures":["dǎng","dàng"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","⺌","彐"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0186","L7-0820","L7-5604"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"bloquer, barrer ; protéger de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"bloquer, barrer, faire obstacle"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"protéger de, abriter de"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"前面的人挡住了我的视线。","pinyin":"Qiánmian de rén dǎngzhù le wǒ de shìxiàn.","fr":"La personne devant moi me cache la vue.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null}}}
